    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience skateboarding with a gravitational twist! <strong>Astro Grind</strong> throws you into a dynamic solar system where each planet boasts its own distinct gravitational pull, influencing your speed, jump height, and trick potential. Learn to harness these forces to execute mind-bending maneuvers and overcome increasingly challenging objectives. As you progress, unlock new planets, discover unique environmental hazards and opportunities, and push your skills to the limit in pursuit of the perfect run.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience skateboarding with a gravitational twist! <strong>Astro Grind</strong> throws you into a dynamic solar system where each planet boasts its own distinct gravitational pull, influencing your speed, jump height, and trick potential. Learn to harness these forces to execute mind-bending maneuvers and overcome increasingly challenging objectives. As you progress, unlock new planets, discover unique environmental hazards and opportunities, and push your skills to the limit in pursuit of the perfect run.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to skate, score, and explore! Travel throughout the solar system where you'll complete challenges and rack up high scores, using each world's unique gravity to your advantage.",
